2, "box": [[83, 746], [793, 729], [794, 752], [83, 770]]}, {"text": "1.Iron andSteel Industry", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[83, 778], [286, 777], [286, 797], [83, 798]]}, {"text": "The iron and steel industry is the basic industry on which all other industries depend. The main", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[80, 800], [841, 784], [841, 810], [80, 826]]}, {"text": "raw materials used in the iron and steel industry are iron ore, coal and limestone. This raw", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[77, 827], [839, 811], [839, 834], [77, 851]]}, {"text": "material is used for the manufacturing of a numbers of other products such as heavy machinery,", "conf": 0.905, "box": [[72, 851], [840, 836], [840, 862], [72, 877]]}, {"text": "and railway coaches. Steel is used to manufacture a variety of products. These include:", "conf": 0.921, "box": [[73, 877], [765, 864], [766, 890], [73, 902]]}, {"text": "Consumerandengineeringgoods,", "conf": 0.949, "box": [[85, 903], [364, 903], [364, 926], [85, 926]]}, {"text": "Medicalandscientificequipments,", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[82, 932], [374, 932], [374, 953], [82, 953]]}, {"text": "Defenceandconstructionmaterials", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[78, 959], [382, 957], [382, 980], [78, 982]]}, {"text": "·Energyandelectricequipments", "conf": 0.88, "box": [[71, 987], [350, 987], [350, 1010], [71, 1010]]}, {"text": "The first iron and steel mill started in", "conf": 0.914, "box": [[66, 1011], [409, 1010], [409, 1033], [66, 1035]]}, {"text": "Karachi in 1973 with the cooperation of", "conf": 0.891, "box": [[63, 1038], [408, 1036], [408, 1060], [63, 1061]]}, {"text": "Soviet Union. All other industries -heavy,", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[61, 1064], [407, 1065], [407, 1088], [61, 1087]]}, {"text": "medium and light depend on it for their", "conf": 0.904, "box": [[59, 1091], [407, 1090], [407, 1113], [59, 1114]]}, {"text": "machinery.", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[57, 1115], [155, 1119], [154, 1143], [57, 1139]]}, {"text": "Iron and steel industry", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[543,